OL,3,GNEWSAI thank heart donor's family for
OL,4,Amy 'fantastic mundane' life
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who got married and had two
OL,7,Fchildren after a heart transplant has
OL,8,Fsaid he will be forever grateful to the
OL,9,Funknown donor's family for his
OL,10,F"fantastic, mundane" life.
OL,12,FKev Rands, from Whiteley, Hampshire,
OL,13,Fwas given the life-saving operation
OL,14,Fwhen he was 27.
OL,16,FHe said it was "crazy" that transplants
OL,17,Fwere often prevented by consent issues
OL,18,Finvolving bereaved relatives.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
