OL,3,GNEWSAI thank heart donor's family for
OL,4,Amy 'fantastic mundane' life
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 41-year-old is taking part in an
OL,7,FNHS campaign, which warns of a
OL,8,F"significant and accelerating decline
OL,9,Fin organ donation and transplantation
OL,10,Facross the UK".
